## Development

```bash
git clone ...

cd CNCguitarwizard

python -m venv .venv

source .venv/bin/activate
# Windows:
# .venv\Scripts\activate

python -m pip install -e .

pytest

python -m cncguitarwizard
```

## Development Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -e .

python -m pytest
python -m cncguitarwizard
```

Initial project structure

- Configuration system
- Parameter dictionary
- Machine profile
- Tool library
- Validation framework
- Documentation skeleton

Quality over speed.

Every commit should improve the project. Never sacrifice stability for progress.
